  "description": "Haru likes drawing since she was young and she is determined to put her all on the latest webtoon contest. Little did she know, she has no knack for writing a good story. Meanwhile, Tristan is a student body leader who secretly has a history of being a fanfic writer. Able to bury it down for years, he is terrified when Haru accidentally finds out. He begs her to keep the secret close, including a promise to assist her in romance--not in the real world, but in the romance story that she writes.",
